OL,3,GNEWSAFirst sections of #8.3m footbridge
OL,4,Aarrive in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first sections of a new #8.3m
OL,7,Ffootbridge have arrived in
OL,8,FPeterborough, as installation work
OL,9,Fbegins.
OL,11,FThree deck sections for Cygnet Bridge
OL,12,Fhave been delivered to the city this
OL,13,Fweek by wide-load convoy, under police
OL,14,Fescort, and will be lifted into place
OL,15,Fin the coming days alongside the
OL,16,Fbridge's mast.
OL,18,FPart of the River Nene has been
OL,19,Ftemporarily closed until 24 December to
OL,20,Fallow the work to be carried out
OL,21,Fsafely.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
