OL,3,GNEWSAFirst sections of #8.3m footbridge
OL,4,Aarrive in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeterborough City Council said the
OL,7,Fbridge would create a more direct route
OL,8,Ffor pedestrians and cyclists between
OL,9,FFletton Quays, the Embankment and the
OL,10,Fcity centre.
